<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>VOISS IEP Planning Suite — Mockup</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --teal-deep: #1a4a4a;
    --teal-mid: #2d7a6e;
    --teal-light: #4aab99;
    --teal-pale: #e8f5f3;
    --amber: #e8a020;
    --amber-light: #fef3dc;
    --slate: #3d4f4f;
    --slate-light: #6b8080;
    --cream: #fafcfc;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --border: #d1e8e4;
    --tag-bg: #d4ede9;
    --tag-text: #1a4a4a;
  }
  body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--cream); color: var(--slate); min-height: 100vh; }

  .header { background: var(--teal-deep); padding: 0 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 60px; }
  .logo { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; color: white; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .logo span { color: var(--amber); }
  .header-nav { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }
  .header-nav a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .header-nav a:hover { color: white; }
  .header-badge { background: var(--amber); color: var(--teal-deep); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

  .hero-band { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--teal-mid) 0%, var(--teal-deep) 100%); padding: 36px 32px 32px; color: white; }
  .hero-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hero-title { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.6; }

  .tabs-bar { background: var(--teal-deep); padding: 0 32px; display: flex; gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
  .tab { padding: 12px 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tab:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
  .tab.active { color: var(--amber); border-bottom-color: var(--amber); }

  .content { padding: 28px 32px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .panel { display: none; }
  .panel.active { display: block; }

  /* GOAL MATCHER */
  .matcher-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; align-items: start; }
  .card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; }
  .card-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--teal-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--slate-light); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .goal-textarea { width: 100%; height: 100px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: var(--slate); resize: none; outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s; line-height: 1.5; }
  .goal-textarea:focus { border-color: var(--teal-light); }
  .goal-textarea::placeholder { color: #aabdbd; }
  .match-btn { margin-top: 12px; width: 100%; background: var(--teal-mid); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .match-btn:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }
  .result-placeholder { background: var(--teal-pale); border: 1.5px dashed var(--teal-light); border-radius: 10px; padding: 32px 20px; text-align: center; color: var(--slate-light); font-size: 13px; }
  .match-result { display: none; }
  .match-result.visible { display: block; }
  .skill-match { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; background: white; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; }
  .skill-match:hover { box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26,74,74,0.08); }
  .skill-match-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .skill-code { background: var(--teal-deep); color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .skill-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); }
  .match-pct { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-mid); background: var(--teal-pale); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; }
  .skill-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--slate-light); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .scenario-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .tag { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--tag-text); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .tag:hover { background: var(--teal-light); color: white; }
  .tag.amber { background: var(--amber-light); color: #7a4500; }

  /* WIZARD */
  .wizard-progress { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .wstep { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1; }
  .wstep:last-child { flex: 0; }
  .wstep-circle { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--border); color: var(--slate-light); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .wstep.done .wstep-circle { background: var(--teal-mid); color: white; }
  .wstep.active .wstep-circle { background: var(--teal-deep); color: white; }
  .wstep-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--slate-light); }
  .wstep.active .wstep-label { color: var(--teal-deep); font-weight: 600; }
  .wstep.done .wstep-label { color: var(--teal-mid); }
  .wstep-line { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 0 8px; }
  .wstep.done .wstep-line { background: var(--teal-light); }
  .wizard-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; max-width: 640px; }
  .wizard-q { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .wizard-hint { font-size: 13px; color: var(--slate-light); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .choice-btn { border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--slate); background: white; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; transition: all 0.15s; line-height: 1.4; }
  .choice-btn:hover { border-color: var(--teal-light); background: var(--teal-pale); color: var(--teal-deep); }
  .choice-btn.selected { border-color: var(--teal-mid); background: var(--teal-pale); color: var(--teal-deep); font-weight: 600; }
  .wizard-nav { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .btn-ghost { padding: 9px 18px; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: white; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--slate); cursor: pointer; }
  .btn-primary { padding: 9px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--teal-mid); font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: white; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }

  /* SCENARIO MAP */
  .scenario-map-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .scenario-search { flex: 1; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: var(--slate); outline: none; }
  .scenario-search:focus { border-color: var(--teal-light); }
  .filter-select { border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: var(--slate); background: white; outline: none; }
  .scenario-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .scenario-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .scenario-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26,74,74,0.1); border-color: var(--teal-light); }
  .scenario-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: var(--teal-mid); }
  .scenario-card.amber::before { background: var(--amber); }
  .scenario-card.highlight::before { background: var(--teal-light); }
  .scen-num { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--slate-light); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .scen-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .scen-skills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .scen-skill { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; background: var(--teal-pale); color: var(--teal-mid); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .scen-iep { font-size: 11px; color: var(--slate-light); line-height: 1.4; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 8px; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* PROGRESS REPORTS */
  .report-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .student-list { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
  .student-list-header { padding: 14px 16px; background: var(--teal-pale); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .student-item { padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.15s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .student-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .student-item:hover { background: var(--teal-pale); }
  .student-item.active { background: var(--teal-pale); border-left: 3px solid var(--teal-mid); }
  .student-avatar { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal-mid); color: white; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .student-info .name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); }
  .student-info .grade { font-size: 11px; color: var(--slate-light); }
  .student-status { margin-left: auto; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 20px; }
  .status-on { background: #d4edda; color: #1a5c2a; }
  .status-at { background: #fff3cd; color: #7a5200; }
  .report-content { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; }
  .report-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .report-student-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-deep); }
  .report-meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--slate-light); margin-top: 3px; }
  .export-btn { background: var(--amber); color: var(--teal-deep); border: none; border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
  .goal-block { background: var(--teal-pale); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .goal-block-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--teal-mid); margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .goal-block-text { font-size: 13px; color: var(--teal-deep); line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 500; }
  .metrics-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .metric-box { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; text-align: center; }
  .metric-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--teal-deep); line-height: 1; }
  .metric-val.green { color: #1a7a3a; }
  .metric-val.amber-c { color: #c07000; }
  .metric-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--slate-light); margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .progress-bars { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .prog-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .prog-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--slate); width: 60px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .prog-track { flex: 1; height: 8px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
  .prog-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--teal-mid); }
  .prog-fill.amber { background: var(--amber); }
  .prog-pct { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); width: 36px; text-align: right; }
  .scenario-completed-list { font-size: 12px; }
  .scen-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .scen-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .scen-check { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal-mid); color: white; font-size: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .scen-row-name { flex: 1; color: var(--slate); }
  .scen-row-score { font-weight: 600; color: var(--teal-deep); }
  .scen-row-date { color: var(--slate-light); font-size: 11px; }

  .mockup-banner { background: var(--amber-light); border-bottom: 1px solid #f0d090; padding: 8px 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #7a4500; text-align: center; font-weight: 500; }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .matcher-layout, .scenario-grid, .report-layout, .metrics-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .choice-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .content { padding: 16px; }
    .header { padding: 0 16px; }
    .tabs-bar { overflow-x: auto; padding: 0 16px; }
    .scenario-map-header { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="mockup-banner">⚡ Concept Mockup — VOISS IEP Planning Suite · For internal review only · Not a live product</div>

<div class="header">
  <div class="logo">VOISS <span>Advisor</span></div>
  <div class="header-nav">
    <a>Scenarios</a>
    <a>Students</a>
    <a>Reports</a>
    <span class="header-badge">IEP TOOLS</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="hero-band">
  <div class="hero-eyebrow">IEP Planning Suite</div>
  <div class="hero-title">Connect IEP Goals to Social Skills Practice</div>
  <div class="hero-sub">Match written goals to VOISS scenarios, track student progress toward benchmarks, and generate IEP-ready progress reports — all in one place.</div>
</div>

<div class="tabs-bar">
  <div class="tab active" onclick="switchTab('matcher', this)">Goal Matcher</div>
  <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('wizard', this)">IEP Wizard</div>
  <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('scenarios', this)">Scenario Map</div>
  <div class="tab" onclick="switchTab('reports', this)">Progress Reports</div>
</div>

<div class="content">

  <!-- TAB 1: GOAL MATCHER -->
  <div class="panel active" id="panel-matcher">
    <div class="matcher-layout">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-label">Step 1 — Paste Your Goal</div>
          <h3>IEP Goal Matching</h3>
          <p>Copy and paste an existing IEP goal or benchmark. VOISS will match it to the skills and scenarios that best address it.</p>
          <textarea class="goal-textarea" id="goalInput" placeholder="e.g. 'Given a social situation, the student will identify the emotional state of a peer based on facial expressions with 80% accuracy across 3 consecutive sessions...'"></textarea>
          <button class="match-btn" onclick="runMatch()">Find Matching Skills & Scenarios →</button>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;" class="card">
          <div class="card-label">Or Browse the Goal Bank</div>
          <h3>Common IEP Need Areas</h3>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:4px;">
            <span class="tag" onclick="fillGoal('emotion')">Emotion Recognition</span>
            <span class="tag" onclick="fillGoal('perspective')">Perspective Taking</span>
            <span class="tag" onclick="fillGoal('conflict')">Conflict Resolution</span>
            <span class="tag" onclick="fillGoal('complaint')">Making Complaints</span>
            <span class="tag" onclick="fillGoal('facial')">Reading Facial Cues</span>
            <span class="tag amber" onclick="fillGoal('body')">Body Awareness</span>
            <span class="tag amber" onclick="fillGoal('annoy')">Handling Annoyance</span>
            <span class="tag amber" onclick="fillGoal('convo')">Conversation Skills</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Step 2 — Review Matches</div>
        <div id="resultPlaceholder" class="result-placeholder">
          <div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:10px;opacity:0.3;">🔍</div>
          <div>Paste a goal and click <strong>Find Matches</strong> to see aligned VOISS skills and scenarios.<br><br>Or click any tag in the Goal Bank to auto-fill an example.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="match-result" id="matchResult">
          <div class="skill-match">
            <div class="skill-match-header">
              <span class="skill-code">SAA 1</span>
              <span class="skill-name">Recognizes Own & Others' Emotions</span>
              <span class="match-pct">94% match</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-desc">Student can identify and label emotional states in self and peers using facial, vocal, and contextual cues.</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--slate-light);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;">Recommended Scenarios</div>
            <div class="scenario-tags">
              <span class="tag">Scenario 13 — Lunchroom</span>
              <span class="tag">Scenario 7 — Hallway</span>
              <span class="tag">Scenario 19 — Classroom</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-match">
            <div class="skill-match-header">
              <span class="skill-code">RCS 6</span>
              <span class="skill-name">Reads Others' Facial Expressions</span>
              <span class="match-pct">88% match</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-desc">Student orients to peers' faces, interprets expression cues, and adjusts response based on perceived emotional state.</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--slate-light);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;">Recommended Scenarios</div>
            <div class="scenario-tags">
              <span class="tag">Scenario 13 — Lunchroom</span>
              <span class="tag">Scenario 4 — PE Class</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-match">
            <div class="skill-match-header">
              <span class="skill-code">SRS 3</span>
              <span class="skill-name">Connects Emotions to Body Sensations</span>
              <span class="match-pct">71% match</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skill-desc">Student describes physical sensations associated with emotional states and can identify the emotion connected to a bodily feeling.</div>
            <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--slate-light);margin-bottom:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;">Recommended Scenarios</div>
            <div class="scenario-tags">
              <span class="tag">Scenario 13 — Lunchroom</span>
              <span class="tag amber">Scenario 2 — Recess</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--amber-light);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#7a4500;line-height:1.5;">
            <strong>Suggested IEP Benchmark:</strong> Given a peer interaction in a structured VOISS scenario, [student] will correctly identify the emotional state of a peer using facial expression cues with ≥80% accuracy across 3 consecutive sessions.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 2: WIZARD -->
  <div class="panel" id="panel-wizard">
    <div class="wizard-progress">
      <div class="wstep done" id="ws1"><div class="wstep-circle">✓</div><div class="wstep-label">Area of Need</div></div>
      <div class="wstep-line"></div>
      <div class="wstep active" id="ws2"><div class="wstep-circle">2</div><div class="wstep-label">Current Behavior</div></div>
      <div class="wstep-line"></div>
      <div class="wstep" id="ws3"><div class="wstep-circle">3</div><div class="wstep-label">Target Behavior</div></div>
      <div class="wstep-line"></div>
      <div class="wstep" id="ws4"><div class="wstep-circle">4</div><div class="wstep-label">Measurement</div></div>
      <div class="wstep-line"></div>
      <div class="wstep" id="ws5"><div class="wstep-circle">5</div><div class="wstep-label">Results</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wizard-card">
      <div class="wizard-q">What does the student currently do?</div>
      <div class="wizard-hint">Select the description that best matches the student's present level in social-emotional situations.</div>
      <div class="choice-grid">
        <button class="choice-btn" onclick="selectChoice(this)">Rarely identifies emotions in others, even with obvious cues</button>
        <button class="choice-btn selected" onclick="selectChoice(this)">Identifies basic emotions (happy/sad) but misses subtle or blended expressions</button>
        <button class="choice-btn" onclick="selectChoice(this)">Can identify emotions but struggles to respond appropriately</button>
        <button class="choice-btn" onclick="selectChoice(this)">Identifies and responds correctly in 1:1 settings, not in groups</button>
      </div>
      <div class="wizard-nav">
        <button class="btn-ghost">← Back</button>
        <button class="btn-primary">Next →</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:16px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--teal-pale);border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--teal-deep);line-height:1.6;">
      <strong>So far:</strong> Area of need — <em>Emotion Recognition</em> → Current level — <em>Identifies basic emotions, misses subtleties</em>. Keep going to generate your recommended scenarios and IEP benchmark.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 3: SCENARIO MAP -->
  <div class="panel" id="panel-scenarios">
    <div class="scenario-map-header">
